flowchart TB
  ABC[/ABC RSS and GDELT<br/>candidate discovery/]
  CONFIRM[/Official NRL or club<br/>or two independent sources/]
  VOLUME[/GDELT timelinevolraw<br/>daily article counts only/]
  FIXTURES[/Round fixtures<br/>true UTC kickoff/]

  DISCOVER([Rights-aware discovery<br/>links and timestamps only])
  ARTICLES[(context_article_snapshots<br/>no article bodies)]
  REVIEW{Evidence · rights · entity<br/>and confidence gate}
  QUEUE[(Pending review<br/>ineligible)]
  EVENTS[(context_events<br/>+ disposition · availability)]
  ATTENTION[(context_attention_series<br/>counts · no text · 2017 on)]
  CUTOFF([One round cutoff<br/>historical 11:00 Sydney · live captured once])
  FEATURES([Shared features<br/>home · away · delta · orientation])

  PROD[[Production model<br/>unchanged probabilities]]
  CANDIDATE[[Shadow refit candidate<br/>same folds and seed]]
  ABLATION([Paired nested season-out ablation<br/>asks: does the family help the model?])
  OFFSET([Cohort-restricted offset<br/>asks: does the cohort carry signal?])
  PLACEBO{Pre-event placebo<br/>same clubs · before the event}
  REPORT[(Materiality reports<br/>effect · uncertainty · prevalence)]

  FACTS([Eligible observed facts<br/>summary + source link])
  SAFETY{Deterministic safety layer<br/>copy policy passes?}
  FALLBACK([Factual fallback<br/>no causal claim])
  REG([Reg copy<br/>locked facts only])
  READER[/Context Watch<br/>email and site/]
  GUARD{Value guard flag<br/>default off}
  PICKS[/Value picks and stakes/]

  RUN[(context_prediction_runs<br/>immutable decision + hash)]
  SNAPSHOT[(prediction_context<br/>immutable game/event/features)]

  ABC --> DISCOVER --> ARTICLES
  CONFIRM --> ARTICLES
  ARTICLES --> REVIEW
  REVIEW -->|pending or rejected| QUEUE
  REVIEW -->|eligible| EVENTS
  VOLUME --> ATTENTION
  EVENTS --> CUTOFF
  ATTENTION --> CUTOFF
  FIXTURES --> CUTOFF
  CUTOFF --> FEATURES

  FEATURES -.->|candidate only| CANDIDATE
  PROD -.->|baseline OOF rows| ABLATION
  CANDIDATE -.->|paired OOF rows| ABLATION
  PROD -->|baseline held fixed| OFFSET
  FEATURES -->|signed exposure| OFFSET
  OFFSET --> PLACEBO
  PLACEBO -->|gap absent before| REPORT
  PLACEBO -->|gap already present<br/>selection not effect| REPORT
  ABLATION --> REPORT

  EVENTS --> FACTS --> SAFETY
  SAFETY -->|pass| REG --> READER
  SAFETY -->|fail| FALLBACK --> READER

  FEATURES -.->|affected side| GUARD
  GUARD -.->|off: unchanged| PICKS
  GUARD -.->|on: stake withheld| PICKS

  CUTOFF --> RUN
  FEATURES --> SNAPSHOT
  FACTS --> SNAPSHOT
  RUN --> SNAPSHOT
  SNAPSHOT -->|exact observed context| READER

  classDef source fill:#CFFAFE,stroke:#0891B2,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef process fill:#E0F2FE,stroke:#0369A1,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef data fill:#CCFBF1,stroke:#0F766E,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef model fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#F59E0B,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef decision fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;

  class ABC,CONFIRM,VOLUME,FIXTURES,READER,PICKS source;
  class DISCOVER,CUTOFF,FEATURES,ABLATION,OFFSET,FACTS,FALLBACK,REG process;
  class ARTICLES,QUEUE,EVENTS,ATTENTION,REPORT,RUN,SNAPSHOT data;
  class PROD,CANDIDATE model;
  class REVIEW,SAFETY,PLACEBO,GUARD decision;
